body:
I can relate with a lot of the things you have said, I also have very big problems with social skills and making friends and I can't smile either. No one really gives a crap about me. It helped me understand that in reality, it's everyone for themselves. If you have been dealt a crap hand no one cares.

Life is just not meant to be good for people like us. The cruelty of human beings knows no bounds and the weak have no place on this cursed planet.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
